---
output: svg
---
@startuml
' The shared internal "tips" entity is keyed by class+position only, so
' it does not matter whether the members being noted are fields or
' methods: both share it, and both must keep their own color.
class E {
  int field1
  doThing()
}
note right of E::field1 #yellow
  field note yellow
end note
note right of E::doThing #lightblue
  method note lightblue
end note
@enduml
